      <h1>Evaluation Metrics for <span class="accent">Classification</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Master the essential metrics for evaluating classifier performance beyond simple accuracy, understanding precision, recall, F1-score, and ROC curves.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Learning Objectives -->
    <div class="objectives">
      <h4>Learning Objectives</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand when accuracy is misleading and what to use instead</li>
        <li>Calculate and interpret precision, recall, and F1-score</li>
        <li>Build and interpret confusion matrices</li>
